      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAY UP SALLY (2) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing sixth (25.11) in a Grade 5 at Bendigo. Comes through a solid form race last start. Can atone. ONCIDIUM (1) was below best at his last couple, the latest finishing fourth at this track, but was among the placings at Traralgon three back. Expected to bounce back to best. WARRIOR JACK (6) filled a minor placing last start at this track behind Pretty Panama (23.13) in a Bottom Up - Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Expecting another good run. CHEEKY ALESSIA (3) will need to repeat last run to feature.",
